<< examples/java/differential/MathSqrt.sleela
   SLeeLa side of the MathSqrt differential test.
   Definition: prints, line for line, the same results as MathSqrt.java: the bits of
   Math.sqrt for 240 values, so a one-ulp error shows. Java requires sqrt to be
   correctly rounded (IEEE 754); lib/java/jdk-28 Math.sqrt rounds with the
   Tuckerman test after Newton on an exactly scaled argument. >>
#sleela 3.1
